    correct: ["b"],
    explanation: "B is correct because footprinting builds a structured information profile of the target that can guide subsequent assessment activities. A is unrelated to reconnaissance. C incorrectly assumes vulnerabilities should immediately be exploited; reconnaissance precedes such actions. D is an attack objective rather than a footprinting objective."
