    type: "multiselect",
    prompt: "Which three controls can help an organization reduce exposure discovered through underground intelligence?",
    scenario: "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A threat-intelligence report confirms that employee credentials associated with the organization's domain are being advertised.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
