    explanation: "Line l3 permits alice to run /usr/bin/less as root. Certain privileged utilities may provide pathways to execute commands or access protected content depending on configuration, making unrestricted sudo authorization of such a utility risky. The other entries shown do not represent the same user-specific dangerous permission in this context."
