    prompt: "Select THREE characteristics of a reverse shell.",
    scenario: "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>During an authorized lab exercise, a compromised host initiates an outbound connection to a listener operated by the tester. The tester is identifying the characteristics of the resulting shell.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
