    domain: "Denial of Service & Evasion Techniques",
    type: "multiselect",
    prompt: "Select THREE characteristics of proxy chaining as an evasion or traffic-obfuscation technique.",
    scenario: "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>During an authorized assessment, a tester routes traffic through multiple intermediary proxies to evaluate how perimeter controls attribute the originating connection.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
