"prompt": "Click the firewall rule containing the configuration error.",
"scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>The rules below are intended for an authorized Linux firewall configuration. Identify the line containing the misspelled iptables target that will cause the rule to fail.</p></div>",
