    scenario: "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>Review the database-access code and identify the line demonstrating parameter binding rather than string concatenation.</p></div><pre>l1  const id = req.query.id;\nl2  const sql = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = \" + id;\nl3  const result = await db.query(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $1\", [id]);\nl4  return res.json(result.rows);</pre>",
