    "prompt": "Select exactly THREE steps typically performed by an attacker during a classic evil-twin + captive-portal credential harvest.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A detailed attack narrative is being reconstructed for a lessons-learned report.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
