    "prompt": "Select THREE common security vulnerabilities associated with MQTT protocol implementations in IoT environments.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>An auditor is reviewing an insecure smart-home automation network relying on default broker configurations.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
