    "prompt": "Select THREE weaknesses that increase the likelihood of successful privilege escalation inside a cloud account.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A penetration-test report lists several IAM findings that enabled an attacker to move from a low-privilege role to full administrative control.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
