    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A container security assessment is prioritising threats drawn from the OWASP Kubernetes Top 10 and CSA guidance.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
