    "prompt": "Match each multi-tenancy risk to the control that most effectively reduces its likelihood or impact.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A cloud risk-treatment plan is pairing residual multi-tenancy risks with compensating controls.</p></div>",
