    "prompt": "Click the line in the AWS S3 bucket policy that grants public read access to all objects.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A CSPM scan has flagged the following bucket policy as publicly readable. Identify the exact statement responsible.</p></div>",
